                "text": "On Thursday, I was joined by colleagues and advocates to announce the #UFIGHT Act. Millions of women endure severe fibroid symptoms, which disproportionally impact Black women. My #UFIGHT Act authorizes federal grants for early detection, treatment, & research \u2013 it\u2019s needed. https://t.co/YcJ9wcTMlJ",
