                "text": "For too long, women have suffered due to fibroids, without adequate access to early detection or treatment. My new legislation, the #UFIGHT Act changes that, authorizing a new federal grant program.\nIf you fight fibroids, I\u2019m fighting with you. https://t.co/aGRjscMHMP",
